# 🛡️ Fraud Analytics Pipeline

End-to-end fraud analytics project developed with Python, Pandas, SQLite, SQL and Power BI, focused on exploratory fraud analysis, behavioral pattern detection and data storytelling.

This project simulates a real-world fraud analytics workflow, including:

- Large-scale transaction analysis
- Data cleaning and preprocessing
- Feature engineering
- Fraud behavior investigation
- SQL analytics
- Automated chart generation
- Risk pattern identification
- Behavioral fraud analytics
- Interactive dashboard development
- Temporal fraud analysis
- Fraud heatmap visualization

---

# 📊 Power BI Dashboard

Interactive Power BI dashboard built from the cleaned fraud transactions dataset exported by the Python analytical pipeline.

Dashboard pages include:

- Executive Overview
- Merchant & Geographic Risk
- Behavioral Analysis

The dashboard provides:

- Fraud KPIs
- Temporal fraud analysis
- Merchant risk monitoring
- Behavioral fraud heatmaps
- Fraud category analysis
- Geographic fraud analysis
- Interactive risk exploration

---

